    "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:31:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-18T18:31:55Z",
    "body": "Chromium has [`HTMLElement::TopLayerElementPopoverAncestor()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=2340-2362;drc=3f9e9a0f266e9f3f49286ca724553c91909e11c4), if HTML defined a \"get topmost popover ancestor\" algorithm that internally used \"showing hint popover list\" and \"showing auto popover list\", that should make for a slightly cleaner integration with Fullscreen that feels less like poking at internals.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
